{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-09-18T04:20:27.032Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"1ead92a4bde42afa0e8ab261","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-09-18T04:20:27.032Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Dead-code removed: (1) readPmItems JSON.parse catch — unreachable; the pinned pm CLI emits valid JSON on stdout for any zero-exit 'pm --json list' and exits non-zero (caught by the status guard) with the diagnostic on stderr for every failure. Invariant lives in the pinned @unbrained/pm-cli dev dependency (2026.9.17) 'pm --json list' contract; pinned by test. (2) sync/import command non-CommandError catch-and-rewrap ('Linear sync failed:'/'Linear import failed:') — unreachable; syncLinearIssues and every callee (linearRequest, fetchAllLinearIssues, readPmItems, importLinearAtomic) throw only CommandError, so the thrown error already carries its specific exitCode and propagates unchanged. Invariant lives in syncLinearIssues' throw sites; pinned by test."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-18T04:20:27.032Z"}],"before_hash":"f43a5bf973d140ab349c7fe4545d6213dfeeb2398680663d6cd7e4755d895e22","after_hash":"d02c587cd099c20ce6bab0cd05f26ec2650e385ef4e38b9691b2fb0f3faed9dd","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7d16dbb67c3473103d3ce4c8bc83ea6d2a443a7720fc4acabe34920d8d9061eb"}
